							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Geforce GTX 1050 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
